    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbit Maze invites players into a unique maze world where they manipulate the direction of gravity to progress.</strong> Levels take place on cubes, spheres, and other geometric surfaces, challenging your spatial awareness and puzzle-solving skills. Players must walk across these surfaces, avoid falling, and reach the exit gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces a new mechanic, requiring quick reflexes and strategic thinking. Orbit Maze offers a fresh twist on classic platformers and promises an unforgettable experience with its visual style and immersive atmosphere.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbit Maze invites players into a unique maze world where they manipulate the direction of gravity to progress.</strong> Levels take place on cubes, spheres, and other geometric surfaces, challenging your spatial awareness and puzzle-solving skills. Players must walk across these surfaces, avoid falling, and reach the exit gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces a new mechanic, requiring quick reflexes and strategic thinking. Orbit Maze offers a fresh twist on classic platformers and promises an unforgettable experience with its visual style and immersive atmosphere.</p>",
